        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents D06-K538, Rope Edge Quartermain Latchset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Quartermain Latchset features rope detailing on the edge of the escutcheon plate, giving it a traditional appearance that makes it a great choice for historic homes. Choose from any of the available knobs or levers to complete the look. This Quartermain Collection Latchset is available in a huge array of finishes including polished brass, oil rubbed bronze, and satin nickel. It is 7 inches tall and 2-1/4 inches wide. It is adjustable for doors 1-3/8 inches thick or 1-3/4 inches thick with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Choose from dummy, passage, or privacy functions. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Brass Accents D06-K538 Quartermain Collection Latchset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Cast Brass</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\" thick doors</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim on one side of the door. It does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim on both sides of the door. They do not latch and do not lock</b>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latches but does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. The lock is activated by a push button while turning the inside knob/lever releases the lock. It can be opened from the outside with a small tool.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually. The finish for the knob or lever you choose will match the plate finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Quartermain Latchset, Brass Accents D06-K538",
                "description": "Brass Accents D06-K538, Quartermain Latchset - The Quartermain Latchset features rope detailing on the edge of the escutcheon plate, giving it a traditional appearance that makes it a great choice for historic homes. Choose from any of the available knobs or levers to complete the look. This Quartermain Collection Latchset is available in a huge array of finishes including polished brass, oil rubbed bronze, and satin nickel. It is 7 inches tall and 2-1/4 inches wide. It is adjustable for doors 1-3/8 inches thick or 1-3/4 inches thick with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Choose from dummy, passage, or privacy functions.",
